{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"fontaine_current_governance","name_zh":"枫丹现行政体","name_en":"Current Government of Fontaine","aliases":["枫丹现行政体","Current Government of Fontaine"],"category":"institution","scope":"regional","regions":["Fontaine"],"summary":"枫丹当前以沫芒宫为主要行政建筑和治理实体。最高审判官那维莱特在此办公；执律庭负责公共秩序与安全，其下的特巡队偏重处理困难案件和拘捕暴力罪犯，逐影庭则以侦查为主要职责。经历「罪人舞步旋」后，枫丹不再有 Hydro Archon，那维莱特接手了与该头衔相关的事务；现有证据未完整说明枫丹的法定权力层级。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_001","text":"沫芒宫是枫丹当前的治理实体和主要行政建筑，枫丹全境的行政事务在此处理；枫丹人普遍将其视为全国最高权威所在。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_fontaine_current_governance","fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_002","text":"执律庭、Maison Gestion、Maison Cardinalice、Maison Ordalie和逐影庭均以沫芒宫为驻地。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_003","text":"执律庭是枫丹的执法机构，负责公共秩序与安全；特巡队和逐影庭是其两个特别分支。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_004","text":"特巡队负责处理普通警备力量难以应对的困难事务，尤其侧重拘捕暴力罪犯，而非案件调查。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_005","text":"逐影庭是枫丹的特别侦查力量，现今主要调查犯罪活动，直接向最高审判官负责并由那维莱特领导；其成员以美露莘为主。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02","fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_03","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_04"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_006","text":"那维莱特现任枫丹最高审判官，其办公室位于沫芒宫。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_04"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_007","text":"据莱欧斯利评价，那维莱特经过近五百年的公正履职，已被枫丹民众视为律法的象征，其决定会影响整个枫丹。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_04"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_008","text":"据那维莱特所述，枫丹政治体系较为复杂，各部门利益相互牵涉，因此警方可能难以在短时间内查清涉及多个部门的阴谋。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_009","text":"「罪人舞步旋」后，芙卡洛斯及 Hydro Archon 的 divine throne 均被毁，枫丹此后不会再有 Hydro Archon；那维莱特已接手与该头衔相关的事务。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"「罪人舞步旋」结束后至今","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["fandom_fontaine_current_governance"]},{"fact_id":"fontaine_current_governance_fact_010","text":"现有材料未说明沫芒宫内部各部门的完整法定层级，也不能据此确定那维莱特是否是枫丹唯一或法定意义上的最高行政首脑。","status":"unknown","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"not_applicable","source_ids":["fandom_fontaine_current_governance","fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_04"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"约四百多年前至近五百年前","order_hint":1,"events":["据那维莱特自述，他受邀来到枫丹廷担任最高审判官，并开始一系列机构改革。","改革中利益受损的顽固派利用卡萝蕾的身份制造政治风波，迫使那维莱特让出更多权力。"],"current_status":"那维莱特至今仍任最高审判官；现有材料未说明当年的具体改革措施及权力让渡在现行制度中的完整形态。","source_ids":["local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02","local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_04"]},{"period":"「罪人舞步旋」结束后","order_hint":2,"events":["芙卡洛斯及 Hydro Archon 的 divine throne 被毁，枫丹不再有 Hydro Archon；那维莱特接手了与该头衔相关的事务。"],"current_status":"沫芒宫仍是枫丹的治理实体和行政核心，那维莱特仍任最高审判官。","source_ids":["fandom_fontaine_current_governance","fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"枫丹民众通常知道沫芒宫是全国行政事务的核心，知道那维莱特担任最高审判官，也能接触执律庭、特巡队和逐影庭等执法或侦查机构。","likely_known_by":["枫丹普通民众","沫芒宫工作人员","执律庭、特巡队与逐影庭成员","枫丹司法及行政人员","那维莱特"],"unlikely_known_by":["不了解枫丹政务的普通外国人","未参与「罪人舞步旋」核心事件者对 Hydro Archon divine throne 被毁的具体内情","普通民众对沫芒宫内部部门的完整权力边界"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["枫丹人普遍将沫芒宫视为全国最高权威所在。","据莱欧斯利所述，枫丹民众已将那维莱特视为律法的象征。"]},"activation_keys":["枫丹现行政体","Current Government of Fontaine"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["Fontaine页面中的地区解锁、传送、潜水操作、战斗与解谜机制、宝箱和奖励等玩家视角内容。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["将那维莱特直接认定为枫丹唯一或法定国家元首。","推定Maison Gestion、Maison Cardinalice或Maison Ordalie的具体职权。","推定沫芒宫各部门之间未被材料说明的完整隶属层级。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_fontaine_current_governance","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Fontaine","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Fontaine","language":"en","revision_id":"2134720","source_text_sha256":"fd34b883412033b051438f87c44a241f4a479b46fdc4ecc2dec259540cf53cf7"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Palais Mermonia","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Palais_Mermonia","language":"en","revision_id":"1652538","source_text_sha256":"356cc83e465e07b1a8e69407832058749253b62fad5e665cb9562f81d316eece"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Maison Gardiennage","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Maison_Gardiennage","language":"en","revision_id":"2088197","source_text_sha256":"3b61f810663efdcecfc969cb48b4048f49506df06704d8df06b8531941efe63e"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_fontaine_current_governance_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Marechaussee Phantom","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Marechaussee_Phantom","language":"en","revision_id":"2136093","source_text_sha256":"5c9d40b0d08e4c80d9dc17b6d4c505ddd05c01182e776cb745b8ac7b8ebd6e3b"},{"source_id":"local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"似曾相识的威胁","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_14007.json#unit=1400701","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"16d9db21906be54cd32c015fc9ae694e0f80ca5e8b57a0956b3e40773f89b90b"},{"source_id":"local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"黑潮与白露的歌剧","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_4024.json#unit=402411","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"671c52b21ac0c30a5c79761abda3f24f4b3889f05eb59be2fcc4e3fa76fe1fe4"},{"source_id":"local_sup_fontaine_current_governance_04","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"旧事新解","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_14009.json#unit=1400911","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"b64e25298cef156297f7e21fa135bcf2be91255c309726629590f52bd45853f8"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"5f0abffe652221a6fbfae1908e820ecdbbe5e135f1886055a7633de7205e6355","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["沫芒宫被称为最高权威所在的表述带有“就枫丹人而言”的社会认知限定，不能单独证明其精确法定地位。","那维莱特任职时间在对白中分别以“约四百多年前”和“近五百年／五百年来”概述，材料未给出精确就任日期。"],"missing_evidence":["现有材料未明确枫丹现行政体的正式制度名称、最高行政决策职位，以及司法与行政权力的完整分配方式。","现有材料仅确认Maison Gestion、Maison Cardinalice和Maison Ordalie驻于沫芒宫，未说明其具体职权及相互层级。"],"needs_human_review":false}}